msgid "Google Ads conversion label"
msgstr "Etiqueta de conversió de Google Ads"

#: admin/easyPixelsWCAdmin.php:73
msgid ""
"Woocommerce is not installed. This extension has no sense but you can keep "
"it if you love it."
msgstr ""
"Woocommerce no està instal·lat. Aquesta extensió no té gaire sentit però la "
"pots mantenir si t'agrada."

#: admin/page-basicNotInstalled.php:2 admin/page-easyPixelsWCAdmin.php:2
msgid "WooCommerce tracking by <b>JEVNET</b>"
msgstr "Seguiment a WooCommerce per<b>JEVNET</b>"

#: admin/page-basicNotInstalled.php:3
msgid ""
"Track WooCommerce! Works with Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics, Google "
"Ads and Facebook . <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/easy-pixels-"
"ecommerce-extension-by-jevnet/\">More info</a>"
msgstr ""
"Realitza el seguiment de WooCommerce! Funciona amb Tag Manager, Google "
"Analytics, Google Ads i Facebook . <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/"
"easy-pixels-ecommerce-extension-by-jevnet/\">Més info</a>"

#: admin/page-basicNotInstalled.php:11
msgid ""
"The plugin \"Easy Pixels by JEVNET\" is required as core of this plugin."
msgstr "El plugin \"Easy Pixels\" és necessari com a base d'aquesta extensió."

#: admin/page-basicNotInstalled.php:13
msgid "Please, download Easy Pixels and begin to track your sales."
msgstr ""
"Si us plau, descarrega Easy Pixels i comença a realitzar el seguiment de les "
"teves vendes."

#: admin/page-basicNotInstalled.php:14
msgid "Download Easy Pixels"
msgstr "Descarrega Easy Pixels"

#: admin/page-easyPixelsWCAdmin.php:3
msgid ""
"Track WooCommerce! Works with Google Tag Manager, Google Analytics, "
"Microsoft Advertising, Google Ads and Facebook. <a href=\"https://wordpress."
"org/plugins/easy-pixels-ecommerce-extension-by-jevnet/\">More info</a>"
msgstr ""
"Realitza el seguiment de WooCommerce! Funciona amb Tag Manager, Google "
"Analytics, Microsoft Advertising, Google Ads i Facebook . <a href=\"https://"
"ca.wordpress.org/plugins/easy-pixels-ecommerce-extension-by-jevnet/\">Més "
"info</a>"

#: admin/page-easyPixelsWCAdmin.php:15
msgid "Save Settings"
msgstr "Guardar"

#: easyPixelsWC.php:140
msgid ""
"Easy Pixels eCommerce extension plugin is active but WooCommerce is not "
"active or not installed. There is no problem and you can keep it active if "
"you love it. We know love has no sense."
msgstr ""
"L'extensió eCommerce del plugin Easy Pixels està activa però WooCommerce no "
"està actiu o ni tan sols instal·lat. No hi ha problema i ho pots deixar així "
"si estimes aquest plugin. Sabem que l'amor no té sentit."

#: easyPixelsWC.php:152
msgid ""
"Easy Pixels eCommerce extension plugin is active but Easy Pixels is not "
"active or not installed. Please "
msgstr ""
"L'extensió eCommerce del plugin Easy Pixels està activa però Easy Pixels no "
"està actiu o ni tan sols instal·lat. Si us plau"

#: easyPixelsWC.php:153
msgid "activate Easy Pixels"
msgstr "Activa Easy Pixels"

#: easyPixelsWC.php:153
msgid "or"
msgstr "o"

#: easyPixelsWC.php:153
msgid "download it"
msgstr "descarrega'l"

